{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51412","headline":"即席爲诗献徐州节度王智兴（时於使院会饮赋诗） · 张祜","name":"即席爲诗献徐州节度王智兴（时於使院会饮赋诗）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古来英杰动寰区，武德文经未有余。\n王氏柱天动业外，李陵章句右军书。\n（《唐诗纪事》五十四王智兴名下引此诗，前三句作「十年受命镇方隅，孝节忠规两有余。\n谁信将坛嘉政外（第四句同）。\n」又《全唐诗》三百十四王智兴《徐州使院赋》，第一句「三十年前老健儿」，《剧谈录》作「平生弓剑自相随」，第四句「独」作「自」。\n附注於此。\n○《剧谈录》上。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}